<title>FINLAND: Finnish June export prices fell 4.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish June export prices fell 4.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 4.1 percent year-on-year in June and they rose 0.1 percent on May, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated import prices rose 0.2 percent year-on-year in June and they fell 0.3 percent month-on-month, SF said in a statement.</p>
<p>(Export prices:)</p>
<p>		June 1997	   May 1997	June 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +0.1 pct	 +/-0.0 pct	 -0.4 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -4.1 pct	   +4.6 pct	 +1.9 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>		June 1997	   May 1997	June 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     -0.3 pct	   +0.5 pct	 -0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 +0.2 pct	   +1.3 pct	 +1.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
